    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70196" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέννος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mother's</i> or <i>father's
				brother, uncle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				971.26
			</span></i>; but, <i>mother's brother,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).1628
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thera</span>), cj. in Epigr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1033e
			</span></i>; or (in poetry), <i>mother's father,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.16
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόννος</span>
			, q.v.); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάννας,
		νίννη.</span></div>
